5,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a privilege to join you all in this endeavor. To ensure our chosen project is built upon a sustainable foundation, I wish to examine the staffing rolls for technical posts and the minutes on secondments and crew strength.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Hello everyone. I'm very happy to be part of this panel. To understand how the funding actually supports the researchers, I'll look into the travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers and the closeout files of finished awards.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Hi! I'm so excited to help pick a great project! I want to make sure the labs and tools everyone uses are actually ready for more work, so I'll check the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities and the incident logs on shared instrumentation!","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a pleasure to be in such distinguished company. To ensure our ambitions are not thwarted by mundane frictions, I shall examine the portfolio review of schedule overruns and the national repository deposit turnaround.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I believe we should evaluate the actual delivery records of past grants. I will look into the closeout files of finished awards and the portfolio review of schedule overruns to see what was actually achieved.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It is heartening to see such a diverse range of priorities. By looking at both the human element and the systemic records, we shall uncover a truth that serves the greater good of the sciences.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Servas, I agree. It's important that we all bring different perspectives to the table. I hope that by looking at the spending and the final reports, we can find a balanced way to support the researchers.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I agree! It's like a big puzzle, and we're all finding different pieces. I can't wait to see if the shared tools are doing okay so the scientists can do their best work!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"A puzzle indeed, Kenji. Though I suspect some of the pieces may be missing or intentionally obscured. I look forward to seeing if the data reveals a pattern of efficiency or a comedy of errors.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I agree that a pattern of efficiency is what we should seek. I am less interested in the narrative of the proposals and more in the reality of what was delivered on time.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,Wisdom teaches us that the most beautiful plans are only as strong as the hands that carry them out. I believe our collective diligence will reveal the most honest path forward.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I think that's a lovely way to put it, @Servas. I'm looking forward to seeing how our findings overlap so we can make a decision that is fair and supportive for everyone involved.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'm with you! I just hope the tools are in good shape. If the machines are broken or too busy, it doesn't matter how great the plan is, right? Let's find a winner!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, your pragmatism is a refreshing tonic. Indeed, the most brilliant hypothesis is merely a daydream if the equipment is dormant or the bureaucracy is impenetrable. I shall await the evidence with a measured curiosity.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I believe we have a sufficient spread of research topics. I have no further additions to my choices and am ready to see if the historical data supports the promises made in the current proposals.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,"Let us proceed then, with a spirit of openness and unity. I am ready to see what the records reveal and to share in the wisdom we uncover together.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
