24,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I'm all set! I can't wait to see what's happening with the shared facilities. Let's hope everything is running smoothly so we can pick a project that really takes off!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
