86,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,It has been a most illuminating exercise in collective rationality. We have successfully navigated the treacherous waters of biological volatility and bureaucratic decay to find a sanctuary of stability. I am satisfied.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
